      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, right",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>Also, he wanted</li>\n<li>fifteen Malik\u012b</li>\n<li>d\u012bn\u0101rs, pearls and [...]l</li>\n<li>to pierce, if it can be d[one]&nbsp;</li>\n<li>inexpensively. If not, [let it go].</li>\n<li>Also, buy a slave for the [R]ayyis,</li>\n<li>whether a young, pleasant one or</li>\n<li>a good</li>\n<li>[ . . ] at the time of redemption</li>\n<li>from one of the bat[t]les (?). In addition,</li>\n<li>a precious stone should arrive from Ma\u1e0dm\u016bn</li>\n<li>for the purposes of a ring,</li>\n<li>If not, let it go.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>(end)</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
